    "description": "Deterministic, fully unsupervised sorter. It common-median references the recording, estimates per-channel noise with robust MAD statistics, detects negative spatiotemporal peaks with geometry-aware nonmaximum suppression, and extracts aligned multichannel snippets. Waveform PCA, estimated source location, and amplitude features are clustered by diagonal Gaussian mixtures; component count is selected using BIC on the supplied recording. Highly similar or coincident components are merged, while low-support, weak, edge-dominated, or temporally unstable templates are rejected. Final within-unit refractory deduplication prevents duplicate events. Validation uses only internal template stability, morphology, support, and refractory consistency\u2014never hidden labels, a prescribed unit count, or external templates.",
